Reference implementations (GUARD-07, Apache-2.0 section 4(d))
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This crate is a clean-room-adjacent reimplementation: field layouts, constant
values, validation rules and bit-level framing were read from the two Alliance
for Open Media reference implementations below and re-expressed in Rust. Both
are BSD-3-Clause-Clear + AOM Patent License 1.0, which permits this. Functions
that mirror a specific reference function carry a `// ref:` citation naming the
file and symbol they were derived from.

The exact revisions are pinned in REFERENCES.md and must be kept in step with
this file.

